OL,3,GNEWSAMan convicted after being caught
OL,4,Aon CCTV upskirting girl in shopping
OL,5,Acentre
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has pleaded guilty to filming
OL,8,Fbeneath a young girl's skirt in a
OL,9,Fshopping centre before running off and
OL,10,Flater being tracked down on CCTV.
OL,12,FAlex Allegretto, 39, admitted the
OL,13,Foffence of operating a mobile phone
OL,14,Fbeneath the clothing of another person
OL,15,Ffor the purpose of obtaining sexual
OL,16,Fgratification.
OL,18,FPolice were called to St David's 2
OL,19,Fshopping centre on the morning of 7
OL,20,FJuly after a mother reported
OL,21,FAllegretto, who was unknown to them,
OL,22,Ffor upskirting her daughter.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
